{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52446","headline":"回波乐 八十九 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出家多种菓，花蘂竞来新。\n庵罗能逸熟，获得未来因。\n後园多桃李，花盛乱迎春。\n花繁条（一作「枝」）结实，何愁子不真。\n努力勤心种，多留与後人。\n新人食甘菓，惭（一作「愧」）贺（项校「荷」）种花人。\n悉达追远福，学道莫辞贫。\n但能求生路，同证（一作「登」）四果身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}